00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:36.380
CHAPTER 68

00:02:36.920 --> 00:02:41.300
CAPITAL PUNISHMENT!
EXILED TO THE UNDERWORLD

00:02:42.010 --> 00:02:43.050
Welcome!

00:02:49.560 --> 00:02:51.560
E-Empty the register!

00:03:03.570 --> 00:03:06.040
Y-You moron!

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:15.440
Dammit!

00:03:15.440 --> 00:03:18.380
I should've jacked a better car!

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:19.590
Dammit!

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:49.060
What?!

00:03:49.060 --> 00:03:52.330
We're going. Step aboard.

00:04:02.090 --> 00:04:03.720
Drive already!

00:04:05.760 --> 00:04:07.120
Where are we headed?

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:09.500
To where you belong.

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:10.680
What?!

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:43.800
What is that stench?!

00:05:03.690 --> 00:05:05.110
The underworld.

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:09.600
We've been exiled to the underworld.

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:11.370
The underworld?

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:17.060
Underworld exile.

00:05:17.060 --> 00:05:18.730
Underworld exile?

00:05:18.730 --> 00:05:23.780
For your crimes, you're being
sent to the underworld alive.

00:05:23.780 --> 00:05:24.840
Wh...?!

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:27.160
This is crazy!

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:29.680
Turn back! I said turn back!

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:33.680
You... have sinned.

00:05:34.390 --> 00:05:37.770
This is where you belong.

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:41.980
The underworld? Just for that?

00:05:42.820 --> 00:05:44.280
"Just" for that?

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:34.160
<i>I want out.</i>

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:38.290
<i>This... Underworld...</i>

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:45.300
I want out...

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:31.550
Stop!

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:43.180
Don't!

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:47.020
I said don't do it!

00:10:17.470 --> 00:10:18.470
Run!

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:36.610
KITARO'S UNDERWORLD EXILE

00:10:37.610 --> 00:10:41.120
TSUCHIKUMO

00:10:39.130 --> 00:10:40.010
-<i>"I was sleeping."</i>
-<i>"Sorry."</i>

00:10:40.140 --> 00:10:41.010
<i>"Smack!"</i>

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:55.420
Why?

00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:58.510
Why is this happening to me?

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:01.260
Fine. I'm trash.

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:06.290
But... so is the rest of the damn world!

00:11:06.290 --> 00:11:08.140
There are no "good people"!

00:11:08.430 --> 00:11:13.560
Trash stole money from trash.
So why do I get exiled to the underworld?!

00:11:19.780 --> 00:11:20.990
Let's go.

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:23.680
Wh-Where do we go?

00:11:23.680 --> 00:11:25.470
To find an exit.

00:11:25.470 --> 00:11:27.910
We'll be broiled if we stay.

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:30.290
Besides...

00:11:30.790 --> 00:11:33.000
while alone, we might get stuck...

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:37.420
together, we might find a different path.

00:11:38.550 --> 00:11:41.380
When in need, we help each other.

00:11:41.840 --> 00:11:43.740
That's just hypocrisy.

00:11:43.740 --> 00:11:45.800
No it's not.

00:11:45.800 --> 00:11:50.890
Everyone relies on other people
without realizing it.

00:11:51.310 --> 00:11:53.160
That's baloney.

00:11:53.160 --> 00:11:56.690
We're the only "people" here.

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:14.920
What is that? A god or something?

00:12:20.010 --> 00:12:21.050
Dammit!

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:25.050
Is this...?

00:12:26.390 --> 00:12:29.040
Hey! This is <i>sake</i>!

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:30.540
What?!

00:12:30.540 --> 00:12:32.020
Come on!

00:12:40.230 --> 00:12:42.490
Man, I'm drunk!

00:12:47.120 --> 00:12:48.520
What are you doing?

00:12:48.520 --> 00:12:49.870
Giving thanks.

00:12:50.490 --> 00:12:52.650
To who? Your god?

00:12:52.650 --> 00:12:55.860
You've been exiled to the underworld!

00:12:55.860 --> 00:12:58.500
So what got you sent here?

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:04.590
I did... something terrible.

00:13:06.010 --> 00:13:07.180
I...

00:13:08.100 --> 00:13:11.930
ruined the lives of my wife and child.

00:13:12.310 --> 00:13:16.520
I took away their hopes and dreams.

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:20.070
You had an affair or something? You dog!

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:23.570
Why did you commit robbery?

00:13:24.820 --> 00:13:26.740
I'm not sure.

00:13:27.530 --> 00:13:31.290
My dad died in an accident
right after I was born.

00:13:31.580 --> 00:13:35.620
It made my mom neurotic,
and I grew up with her beating me.

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:38.500
I became rotten and left home.

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:41.550
After hopping from job to job...

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:45.050
I fell deep in debt and...

00:13:48.050 --> 00:13:50.490
Join a traveling entertainer group!

00:13:50.490 --> 00:13:51.580
Huh?

00:13:51.580 --> 00:13:54.080
I'm saying, just try anything!

00:13:54.080 --> 00:13:56.040
Great. A drunk lecture.

00:13:56.040 --> 00:13:58.210
There are lots of ways to live!

00:13:58.210 --> 00:13:59.920
Like it'll work out that well!

00:13:59.920 --> 00:14:02.110
It's not about working out!

00:14:04.230 --> 00:14:06.820
It doesn't have to work out.

00:14:08.070 --> 00:14:13.700
Even if it doesn't,
life won't be hopeless.

00:14:14.290 --> 00:14:18.290
"Somebody's watching me
struggle and try hard."

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:20.770
If you don't feel alone...

00:14:20.770 --> 00:14:24.340
life doesn't feel hopeless.

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:28.490
Someone's watching over you!
I know there is!

00:14:28.490 --> 00:14:32.240
Don't give up hope! Things will work out!

00:14:32.240 --> 00:14:34.470
Things will work out!

00:14:46.030 --> 00:14:47.820
What a weirdo.

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:52.350
"Things will work out..."

00:14:52.350 --> 00:14:55.450
As if I'll get a second chance.

00:14:55.450 --> 00:14:58.750
This is... the underworld.

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:03.960
Could it be...

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:07.720
That might lead to the real world!

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:10.090
Hey! Get up!

00:15:52.380 --> 00:15:54.180
We did it!

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:09.280
Me too... Me too...

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:12.910
Me too!

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:29.090
Dammit!

00:17:15.930 --> 00:17:18.050
We did it!

00:17:22.640 --> 00:17:24.440
<i>I'm starting over!</i>

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:26.560
<i>I swear it!</i>

00:17:38.780 --> 00:17:40.490
We're out!

00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:52.380
But...

00:17:55.760 --> 00:17:57.760
This is your fate.

00:17:59.090 --> 00:18:02.490
But... today is <i>obon </i>after all.

00:18:02.490 --> 00:18:04.850
I'll give you a special chance.

00:18:04.850 --> 00:18:06.020
Huh?!

00:18:07.440 --> 00:18:12.520
This return ticket is only issued
during <i>obon</i>.

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:14.690
Unfortunately...

00:18:15.530 --> 00:18:18.070
I only have one.

00:18:36.800 --> 00:18:38.370
You take it.

00:18:38.370 --> 00:18:40.910
Huh?! Wh-Why?!

00:18:40.910 --> 00:18:43.720
Because you're kind...

00:18:44.350 --> 00:18:46.810
and you help people.

00:18:47.140 --> 00:18:48.770
B-But...!

00:18:49.600 --> 00:18:52.650
I realized it traveling with you.

00:18:53.900 --> 00:18:59.240
Because you lifted me up,
I was able to strive on.

00:19:00.160 --> 00:19:07.040
Me, on the other hand, I'm selfish
and I can't be compassionate.

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:10.350
Take care.

00:19:10.350 --> 00:19:14.250
I enjoyed
our journey through the underworld.

00:19:16.460 --> 00:19:17.630
Thanks!

00:19:21.470 --> 00:19:22.930
Kakeru...!

00:19:24.720 --> 00:19:27.640
I did... I did too, Kakeru!

00:19:28.140 --> 00:19:31.190
How did...? Did I tell you my name?

00:19:31.520 --> 00:19:33.190
Oh no...!

00:19:36.030 --> 00:19:40.570
Kakeru Fujimori-san, the one
returning to the real world is you.

00:19:43.070 --> 00:19:47.540
You've changed your ways.
That's why you can leave.

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:49.960
That means...

00:19:56.000 --> 00:19:58.170
I'm sorry, Kakeru.

00:20:01.090 --> 00:20:05.760
I asked for you to be...
exiled to the underworld.

00:20:06.890 --> 00:20:10.020
So you wouldn't have to come here
after you die.

00:20:10.520 --> 00:20:14.810
I wanted you to face your sins.

00:20:16.570 --> 00:20:20.150
Besides, it's my fault.

00:20:20.570 --> 00:20:25.570
I died before I could do anything for you.

00:20:27.740 --> 00:20:30.580
You... Then you're...

00:20:31.330 --> 00:20:35.750
I... ruined the lives of
my wife and child.

00:20:37.130 --> 00:20:38.070
That's right.

00:20:38.070 --> 00:20:41.220
I'm... your dead father.

00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:43.010
Dad...

00:20:43.380 --> 00:20:47.600
I finally got to see you...
but our time's up.

00:20:47.930 --> 00:20:49.100
Kakeru.

00:20:51.520 --> 00:20:58.520
I remember the warmth of your hands
as a baby.

00:20:59.610 --> 00:21:03.700
I still treasure that memory in my heart.

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:06.260
Kakeru.

00:21:06.260 --> 00:21:10.540
You have the power to lift people up, too.

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:13.350
You can always start over.

00:21:13.350 --> 00:21:16.290
Nothing stays the same.

00:21:16.710 --> 00:21:18.590
Things will work out.

00:21:19.040 --> 00:21:21.590
Live life to its fullest.

00:21:33.830 --> 00:21:38.500
POLICE STATION

00:21:34.520 --> 00:21:38.560
<i>Kakeru, I'm always watching over you.</i>

00:21:44.190 --> 00:21:49.120
<i>I'll come to see you</i>
<i>every year during </i>obon<i>.</i>

00:21:44.220 --> 00:21:49.050
